fertile | 6, 6, 24, 24 | The colour taller grass moves towards. From level 7 up, grass blends away from infertile towards this, getting 90 percent of the way at level 15. The game reads only this square's top-left pixel.
infertile | 30, 6, 24, 24 | The colour of short grass, at levels 1 to 6. Taller grass blends away from it towards fertile. The game reads only this square's top-left pixel.
dry | 54, 6, 24, 24 | The colour grass moves towards when the weather is dry. The game reads only this square's top-left pixel.
winter | 78, 6, 24, 24 | The colour grass moves towards in winter, up to 75 percent of the way. The game reads only this square's top-left pixel.
